  "description": "Texas Instruments TPS7A02 nanopower low-dropout linear regulator, fixed 1.8 V output, in the 5-pin SOT-23 (DBV) package: 1.5-6.0 V input, 200 mA output, 25 nA typical ground current (also in dropout), 3 nA shutdown, 450 mV max dropout at 200 mA, ±1.5 % accuracy over temperature, active-high enable with smart pulldown, active output discharge, foldback current limit and thermal shutdown. Stable with a 1 uF ceramic output capacitor.",
